            if(action=="zne"){Fields(f,"scales expectations model");Choice(f,"model","linear");double[] scales=SpinDoctorCalculators.Angles(Req(f,"scales")),values=SpinDoctorCalculators.Angles(Req(f,"expectations"));if(scales.Length<2||scales.Length>64||scales.Length!=values.Length)throw new ArgumentException("Use2..64 matched noise scales and expectations.");double x=0,y=0;foreach(double scale in scales){if(scale<=0)throw new ArgumentException("Noise scales must be positive.");x+=scale;}foreach(double value in values)y+=value;x/=scales.Length;y/=values.Length;double xx=0,xy=0;for(int i=0;i<scales.Length;i++){xx+=(scales[i]-x)*(scales[i]-x);xy+=(scales[i]-x)*(values[i]-y);}if(xx<=1e-24)throw new ArgumentException("Noise scales must not all coincide.");double slope=xy/xx,estimate=y-slope*x,varianceFactor=0,residual=0;double[] weights=new double[scales.Length];for(int i=0;i<scales.Length;i++){weights[i]=1.0/scales.Length-x*(scales[i]-x)/xx;varianceFactor+=weights[i]*weights[i];double err=values[i]-(estimate+slope*scales[i]);residual+=err*err;}if(Double.IsNaN(estimate)||Double.IsInfinity(estimate))throw new ArgumentException("Extrapolation is nonfinite.");return D("zeroNoiseEstimate",estimate,"slope",slope,"weights",weights,"residualSumSquares",residual,"independentEqualVarianceAmplification",varianceFactor,"resultKind","resource-estimate","scope","Ordinary least-squares linear extrapolation to scale0; may amplify variance or leave physical bounds. No extra experiments performed and no physical noise-scaling guarantee inferred.");}
